WEBVTT

00:00:10.885 --> 00:00:15.915
On that cold night, I came to realize

00:00:15.915 --> 00:00:20.895
that there's a place deeper down
that hurts even more than injuries

00:00:20.895 --> 00:00:26.125
In this world painted with lies

00:00:26.125 --> 00:00:30.735
where it's not clear what's true anymore

00:00:30.735 --> 00:00:33.635
I wanted to keep you safe

00:00:33.635 --> 00:00:40.775
The moment that
distortion and love overlapped,

00:00:40.775 --> 00:00:48.855
the wind embraced the
sadness that had closed in

00:00:48.855 --> 00:01:00.165
I'll never forget your sole voice
that continues to echo through the sky

00:01:00.165 --> 00:01:09.005
The prayer is going to melt
away and disappear, just like snow

00:01:09.005 --> 00:01:13.645
Today, I'll increase my speed again

00:01:13.645 --> 00:01:17.745
as I search for the reason for living

00:01:17.745 --> 00:01:29.145
even if I can't be a hero just yet

00:01:58.455 --> 00:02:00.325
Xargin-sama...

00:02:14.805 --> 00:02:16.295
Xargin...

00:02:17.705 --> 00:02:20.675
Sasha has made contact with Xargin!

00:02:20.675 --> 00:02:23.345
Please hurry! I think she wants to...!

00:02:23.345 --> 00:02:27.685
Yes, she probably intends
to settle things herself.

00:02:27.685 --> 00:02:30.285
But... she can't.

00:02:30.285 --> 00:02:31.425
Shido!

00:02:31.425 --> 00:02:33.695
I'm going to pull her out of there!

00:02:33.695 --> 00:02:36.725
I'll watch the Demoniacs surrounding HQ!

00:02:36.725 --> 00:02:38.065
Good.

00:02:38.065 --> 00:02:41.695
Also, how are Amanda and Hermann doing?

00:02:41.695 --> 00:02:44.535
I'm not going to run into them, I hope?

00:02:44.535 --> 00:02:48.175
Don't worry. They show
no signs of leaving D Block.

00:02:48.175 --> 00:02:52.405
I think they're probably searching for Malek.

00:02:52.405 --> 00:02:54.075
Got it.

00:03:16.265 --> 00:03:18.925
Malek... Where are you?

00:03:20.175 --> 00:03:23.305
It's been a long time, I suppose I should say.

00:03:23.305 --> 00:03:26.305
Joseph mentioned that you were still alive...

00:03:26.305 --> 00:03:29.245
Technically, I came back to life.

00:03:30.385 --> 00:03:32.575
To purify you!

00:03:33.515 --> 00:03:34.685
Purify?

00:03:34.685 --> 00:03:37.585
In other words, I'm going to put an end

00:03:37.585 --> 00:03:43.025
to the sins you've committed,
as well as your own suffering!

00:03:43.025 --> 00:03:46.025
Sasha. You're...

00:03:46.025 --> 00:03:48.065
Don't move!

00:03:48.065 --> 00:03:50.105
Can you shoot me, Sasha?

00:03:50.105 --> 00:03:52.935
I'm not the same person I used to be!

00:03:52.935 --> 00:03:55.565
Then go ahead and shoot.

00:04:00.375 --> 00:04:04.245
Shoot him, Sasha! Don't
let this opportunity slip away!

00:04:04.245 --> 00:04:08.185
Commander! Squad #7's
Paladins have been wiped out!

00:04:08.185 --> 00:04:10.225
You still can't stop them?!

00:04:10.225 --> 00:04:13.825
If we attack recklessly, we could
damage the interior of the base!

00:04:13.825 --> 00:04:15.825
You're worried about damage

00:04:15.825 --> 00:04:21.165
when we're surrounded by 30,000 Demoniacs?!

00:04:21.165 --> 00:04:24.605
I don't care if you half destroy
the base! Just take care of them!

00:04:24.605 --> 00:04:26.095
Understood!

00:04:29.005 --> 00:04:33.645
This place is too big! Don't
you have any clues, Amanda?!

00:04:33.645 --> 00:04:39.285
They wouldn't tell me anything
about Malek! All we can do is search!

00:04:39.285 --> 00:04:42.945
Let's just hope this place isn't
in cinders by the time we find him!

00:04:48.725 --> 00:04:50.385
What is it?!

00:04:52.565 --> 00:04:55.465
Hey, Amanda! What're you doing?!

00:04:55.465 --> 00:04:58.305
- This is...
- Huh? What's what?

00:04:58.305 --> 00:05:01.375
It's a paper crane. An old
Japanese leisure activity...

00:05:01.375 --> 00:05:05.895
Huh? Who cares about that?! Let's get going!

00:05:09.815 --> 00:05:12.615
But what's it doing here?

00:05:18.025 --> 00:05:20.295
Herman. What's behind this door?

00:05:20.295 --> 00:05:23.955
It says it's just a stockroom.
It's nothin' special!

00:05:25.995 --> 00:05:27.655
Hey!

00:05:39.245 --> 00:05:40.145
Malek!

00:05:40.145 --> 00:05:41.805
What?!

00:05:48.155 --> 00:05:49.815
Malek!

00:05:54.855 --> 00:05:59.125
Alright! Now let's say goodbye to this place!

00:06:00.835 --> 00:06:04.165
But how did you know, Amanda?

00:06:09.235 --> 00:06:11.735
"Petra"

00:06:13.005 --> 00:06:14.675
It couldn't be?!

00:06:17.345 --> 00:06:20.215
Xargin! There's still time!

00:06:20.215 --> 00:06:24.525
Even in your current form you can
still atone for your sins as a person!

00:06:24.525 --> 00:06:27.195
You can even end your suffering!

00:06:27.195 --> 00:06:32.395
It's so strange to know that you
don't understand anything, Sasha...

00:06:32.395 --> 00:06:36.435
I'm not the one who
committed sins. Humanity was.

00:06:36.435 --> 00:06:38.605
It is the world that is filled with suffering.

00:06:38.605 --> 00:06:42.005
And it is humanity that must atone.

00:06:42.005 --> 00:06:44.545
By ending the world?

00:06:44.545 --> 00:06:45.375
Yes.

00:06:45.375 --> 00:06:47.615
You don't have the right!

00:06:47.615 --> 00:06:50.405
- This is my duty.
- Lt's arrogance!

00:06:55.915 --> 00:07:00.225
If the world is filled with suffering,
then humanity will change it!

00:07:00.225 --> 00:07:01.725
It's in life that...

00:07:01.725 --> 00:07:06.225
In life, what have people done?

00:07:06.225 --> 00:07:07.665
Sasha.

00:07:07.665 --> 00:07:12.865
Was it not people who killed
you and drove the children to death?

00:07:16.475 --> 00:07:21.245
There are very few lives worth living.

00:07:21.245 --> 00:07:22.905
Xargin...

00:07:26.345 --> 00:07:30.215
This world must end.

00:07:30.215 --> 00:07:34.395
It must be purified, to borrow your own phrase.

00:07:34.395 --> 00:07:38.795
And it will happen soon. The Apocalypse is nigh.

00:07:42.095 --> 00:07:43.755
Xargin!

00:07:46.535 --> 00:07:52.145
Joseph said you were
still alive. But he was wrong.

00:07:52.145 --> 00:07:56.605
You died on that day.

00:07:58.585 --> 00:08:01.605
As did I.

00:08:09.595 --> 00:08:12.185
Yes...

00:08:31.885 --> 00:08:33.545
Sasha!

00:08:35.415 --> 00:08:38.785
Do you want that man to kill you?!

00:08:38.785 --> 00:08:40.355
No...

00:08:40.355 --> 00:08:42.555
Xargin has entered A Block!

00:08:44.125 --> 00:08:47.795
If he wanted to destroy this place,
he could simply mobilize that horde.

00:08:47.795 --> 00:08:51.105
The fact he's come inside
without doing so must mean...

00:08:51.105 --> 00:08:56.475
...that Zwolf's nerve
center is what he's after...

00:08:56.475 --> 00:08:58.645
That, or data on the Isis!

00:08:58.645 --> 00:09:00.305
Let's return to the Knights!

00:09:08.685 --> 00:09:10.345
Joseph!

00:09:11.155 --> 00:09:14.255
Come on! Forget about him!

00:09:14.255 --> 00:09:16.025
I'm taking him with us!

00:09:16.025 --> 00:09:17.685
Ugh!

00:09:18.565 --> 00:09:20.225
Let's go!

00:09:25.105 --> 00:09:28.075
Xargin is headed for the main server room!

00:09:28.075 --> 00:09:31.805
What?! He's after the Isis?!

00:09:33.145 --> 00:09:35.275
I'll go and put a security lock on it!

00:09:35.275 --> 00:09:36.875
It's too dangerous!

00:09:36.875 --> 00:09:40.715
As commander, only I can enter the server room!

00:09:49.125 --> 00:09:50.495
What's he doing?

00:09:50.495 --> 00:09:52.865
He entered C Block from A Block!

00:09:52.865 --> 00:09:55.665
He's headed for the main
server room, just as we thought!

00:09:55.665 --> 00:10:00.475
Damn. If he takes control of that,
he'll basically take control of Zwolf.

00:10:00.475 --> 00:10:04.005
Mei-Fong. Let's take some Paladins and stop him.

00:10:04.005 --> 00:10:05.305
Sasha, you...

00:10:05.305 --> 00:10:09.015
I'll make a backup of the Isis
and delete it from the main server.

00:10:09.015 --> 00:10:11.845
All right! Let's go, Mei-Fong!

00:10:27.195 --> 00:10:28.735
They're not chasing us.

00:10:28.735 --> 00:10:32.405
But I guess given their situation,
they don't have time for us...

00:10:32.405 --> 00:10:36.375
And then there's Malek...
It seems creepy how lucky we've been...

00:10:36.375 --> 00:10:41.815
Yeah. Someone helped us and
even showed us where to escape...

00:10:41.815 --> 00:10:46.405
Someone, huh? So, where is
this "someone" telling us to go?

00:10:46.745 --> 00:10:48.115
"Petra"

00:10:48.115 --> 00:10:51.755
"Petra"
Petra... That's my aunt's name.

00:10:51.755 --> 00:10:52.285
Petra... That's my aunt's name.

00:10:52.285 --> 00:10:54.425
She runs an orphanage.

00:10:54.425 --> 00:10:56.255
And we're supposed to go there?!

00:10:56.255 --> 00:10:59.395
Is it really a good idea to
barge into an orphanage?!

00:10:59.395 --> 00:11:04.305
She's a member of a volunteer
group with an international network.

00:11:04.305 --> 00:11:08.075
They might help us out if
we ask them for assistance.

00:11:08.075 --> 00:11:11.275
Heh, I never knew you had connections like that.

00:11:11.275 --> 00:11:13.605
Let's just hope it isn't a trap.

00:11:13.605 --> 00:11:15.575
Yeah...

00:11:15.575 --> 00:11:19.415
But how did he know?

00:11:19.415 --> 00:11:24.215
Consult your inner self to
decide who the real foe is.

00:11:25.825 --> 00:11:27.485
Shido...

00:11:38.905 --> 00:11:41.135
Mei-Fong! What's his present location?!

00:11:41.135 --> 00:11:46.345
A corridor on Floor 8, G Block!
Two blocks until the server room!

00:11:46.345 --> 00:11:48.175
What about the server room's security?

00:11:48.175 --> 00:11:50.015
I'll take care of that.

00:11:50.015 --> 00:11:51.185
Commander!

00:11:51.185 --> 00:11:52.745
It's too dangerous!

00:11:52.745 --> 00:11:57.255
Sasha is backing up the Isis data!
You should evacuate right away!

00:11:57.255 --> 00:12:02.155
The Isis isn't the only thing in the
server room. All of Zwolf is inside.

00:12:02.155 --> 00:12:03.695
But!

00:12:03.695 --> 00:12:09.265
Stop Xargin! Send all the Paladins we have!

00:12:09.265 --> 00:12:11.565
I have faith in you, Mei-Fong.

00:12:11.565 --> 00:12:14.225
Yes! I will stop him!

00:12:26.745 --> 00:12:30.585
Xargin, how long must
you continue to get in the way?

00:12:30.585 --> 00:12:32.585
Have you forgotten that I let you participate

00:12:32.585 --> 00:12:36.495
in this wonderful plan of
ultimate human evolution?

00:12:59.415 --> 00:13:01.075
Xargin!

00:13:41.255 --> 00:13:42.915
Xargin!

00:13:52.265 --> 00:13:53.925
This isn't over yet!

00:13:58.405 --> 00:14:00.065
Shido...

00:14:14.225 --> 00:14:18.495
We can tend to his cuts later;
for now he needs quiet bed rest.

00:14:18.495 --> 00:14:21.655
Don't open the window. Shut the curtains, too.

00:14:23.465 --> 00:14:25.665
I'm so glad you're all right, Amanda.

00:14:25.665 --> 00:14:29.075
I was worried after Shido contacted me.

00:14:29.075 --> 00:14:31.165
So it was him...

00:14:34.615 --> 00:14:39.745
Shido used this tell me where
Malek was and that we should come here.

00:14:39.745 --> 00:14:41.185
But how does he know about you?

00:14:41.185 --> 00:14:46.385
He always used to help
us with our activities here.

00:14:46.385 --> 00:14:49.995
But he doesn't seem like that type at all...

00:14:49.995 --> 00:14:54.835
Have you seen the photo of his
family with these paper cranes?

00:14:54.835 --> 00:14:59.965
Shido and his wife are
originally from Hiroshima, Japan.

00:14:59.965 --> 00:15:01.275
Hiroshima?

00:15:01.275 --> 00:15:02.605
You understand, don't you?

00:15:02.605 --> 00:15:04.605
Because of the genetic illnesses,

00:15:04.605 --> 00:15:07.635
there was no telling if his
children would live to be adults...

00:15:11.285 --> 00:15:14.885
He decided to donate all his
usable organs to his children

00:15:14.885 --> 00:15:17.255
and give himself an artificial body...

00:15:18.125 --> 00:15:21.755
But that would cost an enormous amount of money.

00:15:21.755 --> 00:15:27.835
So Shido gave up his past too,
left his family, and joined Zwolf.

00:15:27.835 --> 00:15:32.435
He undertook the duty of passing
information to the Japanese government,

00:15:32.435 --> 00:15:36.235
sacrificing himself for his family...

00:15:36.235 --> 00:15:37.405
You can't be serious...

00:15:37.405 --> 00:15:43.535
It's possible Shido saw his
own children in you and Malek...

00:15:45.085 --> 00:15:51.015
...and wanted to keep them
from going through what you have...

00:16:07.505 --> 00:16:09.165
Dad!

00:16:24.985 --> 00:16:26.645
Shido!

00:16:37.635 --> 00:16:40.195
You don't belong here...

00:16:47.375 --> 00:16:48.865
I won't let you go!

00:16:56.215 --> 00:16:57.705
Stop!

00:17:04.025 --> 00:17:05.685
Commander...

00:17:08.065 --> 00:17:10.555
Verified: Commander.

00:17:54.045 --> 00:17:58.875
How many years has it been,
Victor? Ever since I was reborn?

00:18:03.155 --> 00:18:08.615
There's no need to run. Because
I'm here to grant your wish today...

00:18:09.355 --> 00:18:11.015
What?!

00:18:19.605 --> 00:18:20.535
Victor.

00:18:20.535 --> 00:18:25.305
I'm going to give you, yourself,
the ultimate evolution you so long for.

00:18:45.595 --> 00:18:47.525
Commander...

00:19:03.315 --> 00:19:05.675
Grandfather!

00:19:08.715 --> 00:19:10.115
Come here, Mei-Fong!

00:19:10.115 --> 00:19:11.625
Yay!

00:19:11.625 --> 00:19:13.285
You're my treasure!

00:19:13.285 --> 00:19:15.225
I love you, Grandfather!

00:19:15.225 --> 00:19:17.895
Oh, you do? Thank you!

00:19:17.895 --> 00:19:20.195
I love you too!

00:19:23.795 --> 00:19:25.465
Grandfather...

00:19:31.545 --> 00:19:34.475
Xargin-sama...

00:19:34.475 --> 00:19:39.315
My business here is done.
I'm going to set out again.

00:19:39.315 --> 00:19:41.755
I leave this castle in your hands.

00:19:41.755 --> 00:19:43.415
Right.

00:20:03.605 --> 00:20:05.745
Sasha, how's the data?

00:20:05.745 --> 00:20:06.945
It's safe.

00:20:06.945 --> 00:20:09.245
Good. Now we escape!

00:20:13.545 --> 00:20:15.675
Grandfather!

00:20:17.155 --> 00:20:19.085
- This can't be!
- Grandfather!

00:20:20.885 --> 00:20:23.085
Grandfather!

00:20:24.825 --> 00:20:28.365
No... Someone! Someone!

00:20:28.365 --> 00:20:31.165
Grandfather! Grandfather!

00:20:31.165 --> 00:20:33.305
Mei-Fong! Pull yourself together!

00:20:33.305 --> 00:20:36.805
You need to protect the place until we return!

00:20:36.805 --> 00:20:40.135
- Grandfather!
- Mei-Fong! Mei-Fong! Listen!

00:20:51.725 --> 00:20:55.625
N-No... No...

00:20:56.825 --> 00:21:00.555
No!

00:21:13.275 --> 00:21:14.935
Xargin...

00:21:17.075 --> 00:21:22.145
The Xargin I know did die that day...

00:21:54.145 --> 00:22:05.265
I dreamed of that day we chased shooting stars

00:22:05.265 --> 00:22:15.675
What we had kept safe disappeared like sand

00:22:15.675 --> 00:22:19.745
Just another illusion

00:22:19.745 --> 00:22:28.845
Asleep, inside memories

00:22:30.085 --> 00:22:32.385
Wish for the stars

00:22:32.385 --> 00:22:40.925
Holding countless wishes with both hands

00:22:40.925 --> 00:22:43.495
A wish for the stars

00:22:43.495 --> 00:22:51.445
Quietly by your side, as you sleep

00:22:51.445 --> 00:22:57.075
Yes, right next to you

00:22:57.075 --> 00:23:03.055
Holding countless wishes

00:23:03.055 --> 00:23:08.815
Yes, right beside you

00:23:12.395 --> 00:23:16.795
There are immutable feelings.
There is firm determination.

00:23:16.795 --> 00:23:22.175
Even with altered appearances,
their prayers continue to drive them.

00:23:22.175 --> 00:23:26.245
Episode 22: "Drifting Hearts."

00:23:26.245 --> 00:23:29.115
To live, or to die?

00:23:29.115 --> 00:23:32.415
The answer to that lies
only at the end of battle.
